Description: Plasma 6 widget that downloads video and audio with yt-dlp
 kde-plasmoid-yt-dlp is a panel widget. It is not the yt-dlp program.
 .
 The widget keeps its own yt-dlp under the home directory and updates that
 copy daily. It does not replace a system yt-dlp and does not change
 QML paths used by other widgets.
